WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Malaysia is a Southeast Asian federation spanning Peninsular Malaysia and Malaysian Borneo.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Mount Kinabalu in Sabah towers at 4,095 meters, recognized as a UNESCO Global Geopark.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Bahasa Melayu is the national language uniting a multi-ethnic society across all thirteen states.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Traditional attire features Baju Kurung and Baju Melayu tailored with Songket gold-thread textiles.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Celebrated cuisine features fragrant Nasi Lemak served with spicy sambal and crispy anchovies.

